    "heroP": "",
    "crumbs": "Home / Residential cleaning",
    "proseHtml": "<p>Some areas are hard to cover during everyday cleaning: grease near the hob, dust along window tracks, soap residue in the bathroom and dirt held in sofa fabric. A residential deep-cleaning visit gives these areas dedicated attention.</p><p>Choose a full-home package for a broader clean, or book a kitchen, bathroom or upholstery service separately. We clean furnished homes as well as empty properties before moving in or handing them over.</p><p>For full-home bookings, tell us the BHK size, approximate floor area and number of bathrooms. A large 2BHK may need more work than a smaller flat with the same room count. Balconies, additional bathrooms and unusual layouts should be mentioned when booking.</p><p>In furnished homes, we clean accessible surfaces around your belongings. Please secure valuables and clear the areas that need cleaning. Cupboard interiors can be cleaned when they are empty and included in the package. Heavy furniture movement must be discussed in advance.</p><p>Sofa, carpet and mattress shampooing are separately booked services unless stated otherwise. Floor polishing, appliance repairs and renovation debris removal are also outside a standard home-cleaning package.</p><p>For villas and bungalows, share the approximate area, floors, staircase details and photographs. We will confirm the team size and scope before the appointment.</p>",
